```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>My Little Universe 🌙</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            background: #171329;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .universe {
            text-align: center;
            color: #f9d9ff;
            font-family: sans-serif;
        }

        .moon {
            font-size: 100px;
            animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        .star {
            position: absolute;
            font-size: 25px;
            animation: sparkle 2s infinite alternate;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
            50% {
                transform: translateY(-30px);
            }
        }

        @keyframes sparkle {
            from {
                opacity: 0.2;
                transform: scale(0.7);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: scale(1.3);
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="universe">
        <div class="moon">🌙</div>
        <h1>MY LITTLE UNIVERSE</h1>
        <p>A tiny world of dreams ✨</p>
    </div>

    <span class="star" style="top: 20%; left: 20%;">✦</span>
    <span class="star" style="top: 30%; right: 25%;">✧</span>
    <span class="star" style="bottom: 20%; left: 30%;">✧</span>
    <span class="star" style="bottom: 25%; right: 20%;">✦</span>

</body>
</html>
```
